{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/luma22-townx-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":461,"crm_id":"139","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Luma22","slug":"luma22-townx-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2024","developer":"TownX","price":1152158,"display_price":"1.152M","lattitude":25.0666875,"longitude":55.2037376,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Luma 22 is a luxury project from the developer TownX Development. The residences offer residents an unparalleled standard of living, allowing them to enjoy first-class apartments and a convenient location.</p><p>The complex has the best world-class amenities:</p><p>- gym with state-of-the-art equipment and fitness center.</p><p>- Children's playgrounds and play areas.</p><p>- landscaped recreation areas.</p><p>- various supermarkets, stores, restaurants and cafes.</p><p>There are many parks nearby the neighborhood such as Circle Community Park, Roohl Community Park, JVC Castle Park, and Gadaf Park. They are ideal for picnics, relaxing, jogging and biking. The residential complex is ideal for families, with daycare centers and schools within walking distance.</p><p>Luma 22 has a very convenient location, which allows you to quickly get to the main attractions of Dubai. Palm Jumeirah is just 12 minutes away, Mall of the Emirates is 10 minutes away and Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are just 15 minutes away.</p><p>With its advantages, this residential complex is ideal for both personal family living and profitable investments.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/139/images/2023/6/13/bvsphU16xoflW9d05w74o